    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Lament?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lament is a game focused around the 5 Stages of Grief, philosophy, and overcoming the unique challenges that loss brings to those that experience it. While playing the game you will need to find your way through 5 mazes, each larger than the last with an additional obstacle/twist for you to overcome. These obstacles can range from the maze itself, traditional path based obstacles, riddles, or even searching for key items/locations; and the player will need to use their wits and Lantern to see the path ahead..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Low Poly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Puzzle Gameplay: Mazes, Riddles, Obstacles, and Key Item progression. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Visualized Grief &amp; Level Degradation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Professionally Voiced</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hidden Objectives &amp; Black Light Inspired Mechanics</p>",
